  <item>
    <title>55 那些个夏天的交易，是否还是粉红的回忆？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6940143937f52a644e19190f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6940143937f52a644e19190f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 14:28:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目中，我们探讨了NBA交易背后的秘密与故事，尤其是快船队在过去几年的重磅交易。尽管进行了一系列豪赌式的交易，快船的现状却让人感到绝望。我们分析了球队如何将未来的选秀权一一交易，以换取即战力，然而结果却并未达到预期。节目中，我们还回顾了近年来的成功与失败交易，揭示了球队在追求胜利时的纠结与无奈。听众将了解到，在华丽背后，NBA交易的真相是怎样的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:保罗事件与球队交易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">00:08:29</a>:NBA选秀资产揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">00:17:05</a>:哈登交易背后的失败与球队困境：快船的抉择与后果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">00:25:37</a>:太阳的选秀决策与布克的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">00:34:09</a>:雄鹿队的人员变动与教练更迭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">00:42:43</a>:东契奇交易背后的幕后交易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3074">00:51:14</a>:球队薪资限制与巨星抱团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4097">01:08:17</a>:NBA球队总经理的决策者风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4612">01:16:52</a>:图图的蜕变：从二当家到准一把手球员的成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5126">01:25:26</a>:交易球员的挑战：如何在热火的成功中获得合理回报？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5639">01:33:59</a>:哈登的离开与火箭的重建：太阳成为崛起的新势力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：华星 kbb</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a23044549211704e161131/ltyB_46wYo5OcTMWYSBySNfbUcFA.m4a" length="99503805" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:42:32</itunes:duration>
