  <item>
    <title>53 文班亚马：NBA很幸运有你；东部风云诡谲，寻觅新主登基</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6904c87043a4f4a98451f076</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6904c87043a4f4a98451f076</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 14:35:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目中，kbb和华星深入探讨了新赛季西部剩下几支球队以及东部球队的前景。</span></p><span></span><p><span>西部：独行侠、湖人、快船、马刺</span></p><span></span><p><span>东部：尼克斯、雄鹿、76人、骑士、活塞、魔术、热火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">00:02:36</a>:选秀权背后的球员交易：东契奇与浓眉的互换对于球队的影响如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">00:19:15</a>:状元秀的困境：独行侠战绩堪忧，球队缺乏持球手的问题如何解决？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">00:28:50</a>:疲惫的快船：年龄、伤病和疲劳的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">00:38:29</a>:文班休赛期的训练方式：提升身体协调性和东方力量的神秘之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">00:48:07</a>:文班的未来之路：慢慢建立属于自己的王朝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3463">00:57:43</a>:NBA球队竞争力：球迷心理与球队表现的关系研究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4044">01:07:24</a>:尼克斯与雄鹿：球队实力与休赛期操作的比较分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5199">01:26:39</a>:魔术队的困境：前场核心确定，但进攻成问题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5775">01:36:15</a>:米切尔与加兰的配合问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6353">01:45:53</a>:NBA杯：商业环境下的双赢局面</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm：KMurdock Music Group - get off the pot_（据说是AI创造歌曲）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：kbb 华星</span></p>]]></description>
